# Real signing key + its passwords — generated locally with `keytool`, never committed.
# Mirrors arthquest-pwa's own android/ convention (see native/README.md). *.keystore is a
# defense-in-depth catch-all in case one ever gets created outside keystore/ by mistake — the
# documented location is always native/keystore/release.keystore.
/keystore/
*.keystore
*.keystore.properties
